OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Rain will spread to the
OL,7,FWestern Isles, Skye and Lochaber later
OL,8,Fin the night. Remaining largely dry
OL,9,Fand cloudy elsewhere.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,12,Fmoving northeast, although the east
OL,13,Fwill see more in the way of drier
OL,14,Fweather.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA few
OL,17,Fshowers on Monday. Rain spreading east
OL,18,Fon Tuesday morning followed by
OL,19,Fshowers. Rain spreading northeast on
OL,20,FWednesday.
